{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/page,_N_T_/,_N_T_/index"},"segmentPaths":["/_tree","/_full","/__PAGE__"],"prefetchHints":{"hints":64,"slots":{"children":{"hints":160,"slots":null}}},"routeCache":{"key":"/route-cache/APP_PAGE/c6377dd9ce6a1c2cd100eb4344e843eb4639b9ed26f84643f77680e9eb454c4b/$/index","owner":{"kind":"APP_PAGE","sourceRoute":"/page"},"isFallback":false}},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, maximum-scale=1, user-scalable=no, viewport-fit=cover\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/3xe3hk643tt-x.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/12jg43355bbw3.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/22579k2m_q2sx.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/3wbm-994r45kr.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/turbopack-3-ry682tkyiqk.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0umf92h1sb77c.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/2buwumlb6g4l0.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0zn_lpijw6n_5.js\" async=\"\"></script><title>光阴的故事 · 第∞号当铺</title><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0cz1d0mv5g_q7.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><canvas id=\"stars\"></canvas><div id=\"gate\"><div><div class=\"gate-kicker\">第 ∞ 号当铺 · 今 夜 开 张</div><h1 class=\"gate-title\">光阴的故事</h1><p class=\"gate-sub\">存进来的是光阴，<br/>换走的是对自己的洞见。</p><button class=\"btn big\" id=\"gateGo\">推门而入</button><div class=\"gate-foot\">光阴的故事 Demo V1.0</div></div></div><div class=\"nebula n1\"></div><div class=\"nebula n2\"></div><div class=\"nebula n3\"></div><div id=\"coach\" class=\"hidden\"><div class=\"coach-card\"><div class=\"coach-kicker\"><span>第∞号当铺 · 开业指引</span><span id=\"coachSkip\">跳过</span></div><h3 id=\"coachTitle\"></h3><p id=\"coachBody\"></p><div class=\"coach-foot\"><button class=\"btn sm\" id=\"coachPrev\">上一步</button><div class=\"coach-dots\" id=\"coachDots\"></div><button class=\"btn gold sm\" id=\"coachNext\">下一步</button></div></div></div><div id=\"app\"><div id=\"topbar\"><div class=\"brand\">光阴的故事<small>PAWN SHOP No.∞</small></div><div class=\"hd-r\"><button class=\"icb\" id=\"btnBox\" title=\"月光宝盒\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M20.5 14.5A8.5 8.5 0 0 1 9.5 3.5a8.5 8.5 0 1 0 11 11z\"></path><path d=\"M15.5 6.2l.6 1.5 1.5.6-1.5.6-.6 1.5-.6-1.5-1.5-.6 1.5-.6.6-1.5z\"></path></svg></button><button class=\"icb\" id=\"btnSet\" title=\"当铺后台\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3.2\"></circle><path d=\"M12 2.8v2.6M12 18.6v2.6M2.8 12h2.6M18.6 12h2.6M5.5 5.5l1.8 1.8M16.7 16.7l1.8 1.8M18.5 5.5l-1.8 1.8M7.3 16.7l-1.8 1.8\"></path></svg></button></div></div><div id=\"deck\"><section class=\"pane\" id=\"pHome\"><div class=\"hero\"><div class=\"dateline\" id=\"heroDate\"></div><div class=\"sign\"><svg class=\"hw l\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 34\"><path d=\"M1 1h10v10H1z\"></path><path d=\"M4 4v4h4V4\"></path><path d=\"M1 13h10v10H1z\"></path><path d=\"M4 16v4h4v-4\"></path><path d=\"M1 25h10v8H1z\"></path><path d=\"M4 28v3h4v-3\"></path></svg><div class=\"sign-b\"><div class=\"sign-cn\">第∞号当铺</div><div class=\"sign-en\">PAWN SHOP No.∞</div></div><svg class=\"hw r\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 34\"><path d=\"M1 1h10v10H1z\"></path><path d=\"M4 4v4h4V4\"></path><path d=\"M1 13h10v10H1z\"></path><path d=\"M4 16v4h4v-4\"></path><path d=\"M1 25h10v8H1z\"></path><path d=\"M4 28v3h4v-3\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"sign-open\">今 夜 营 业</div><div class=\"counter\" id=\"heroCount\"></div></div><div class=\"grid\"><div class=\"card\" data-go=\"time\" style=\"--gl:rgba(240,200,130,.22);--gc:rgba(240,211,148,.4);--gc2:#F0D394\"><div class=\"no\">No.01</div><div class=\"knob\"></div><div class=\"emblem\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"8.6\"></circle><path d=\"M12 7.2V12l3 2.2\"></path></svg></div><h3>时间都去哪儿了</h3><p>说出计划，再说出实际<br/>AI 替你看看它们差在哪</p><div class=\"stat\" id=\"stTime\"></div></div><div class=\"card\" data-go=\"money\" style=\"--gl:rgba(143,216,196,.18);--gc:rgba(143,216,196,.36);--gc2:#8FD8C4\"><div class=\"no\">No.02</div><div class=\"knob\"></div><div class=\"emblem\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"8.4\"></circle><path d=\"M12 7.4v9.2M9.4 9.8h4.2a2 2 0 0 1 0 4.4H9.4\"></path></svg></div><h3>我的钱都去哪儿了</h3><p>一句话记一笔，自动归类<br/>和上周比一比多还是少</p><div class=\"stat\" id=\"stMoney\"></div></div><div class=\"card\" data-go=\"mood\" style=\"--gl:rgba(191,163,232,.18);--gc:rgba(191,163,232,.36);--gc2:#BFA3E8\"><div class=\"no\">No.03</div><div class=\"knob\"></div><div class=\"emblem\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 21c0-5.5 3.4-9.6 8-10.6-.6 5.6-3.8 9.4-8 10.6z\"></path><path d=\"M12 21c0-5.5-3.4-9.6-8-10.6.6 5.6 3.8 9.4 8 10.6z\"></path><path d=\"M12 21v-6\"></path></svg></div><h3>心情树洞</h3><p>在这里分享你的喜怒哀乐，<br/>甚至可以自己定义心情标签。<br/>树会长出你的心情年轮。</p><div class=\"stat\" id=\"stMood\"></div></div><div class=\"card\" data-go=\"dream\" style=\"--gl:rgba(242,169,188,.16);--gc:rgba(242,169,188,.34);--gc2:#F2A9BC\"><div class=\"no\">No.04</div><div class=\"knob\"></div><div class=\"emblem\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M20.5 14.5A8.5 8.5 0 0 1 9.5 3.5a8.5 8.5 0 1 0 11 11z\"></path><path d=\"M15.5 6.2l.7 1.7 1.7.7-1.7.7-.7 1.7-.7-1.7-1.7-.7 1.7-.7.7-1.7z\"></path></svg></div><h3>白日梦想家</h3><p>记录你的奇思妙想、未来想成为<br/>什么样的人、立 flag，<br/>或者写封信给未来的自己。</p><div class=\"stat\" id=\"stDream\"></div></div></div><button class=\"boxbtn\" id=\"btnBoxHome\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M20.5 14.5A8.5 8.5 0 0 1 9.5 3.5a8.5 8.5 0 1 0 11 11z\"></path><path d=\"M15.5 6.2l.6 1.5 1.5.6-1.5.6-.6 1.5-.6-1.5-1.5-.6 1.5-.6.6-1.5z\"></path></svg>月光宝盒</button><button class=\"mem-link\" id=\"memEntry\">点击这里，走进你们的纪念册</button><div class=\"quotes\" id=\"homeQuote\"